# Build output. `bin\handler4805.exe` is reproducible from `handler4805.cpp` by
# running `build-handler4805.cmd`, and a committed binary would be both large
# and unverifiable. `run-handler4805.cmd` rebuilds it on demand, so a fresh
# clone needs no extra step.
bin/
bin-build.log

